s://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for 32-bit Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - pre-AppImage \u00b7 SP Flash Tool\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=macos&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# 2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2\n\nKoensayr is a mod for the Y1's OS that makes the following improvements to the original OS:\n\nBrowsing the albums of an artist from Main Menu > Artists > Albums\n\nAdds Bluetooth remote control support and track info displayed on your bluetooth receiver, perfect for using your Y1 in a car with the infotainment system.\n\n\n---\n\n## Build metadata\n\nPatched **rom.zip** built from stock **3.0.2** by [koensayr-auto](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto) v2.4.0.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- Repository: [`y1-community/y1-stock-rom`](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom)\n- Release tag: `3.0.2`\n- Asset: `rom.zip`\n- Upstream SHA256: `7ee9aa5bf1c134f71e1f41d92cb90975f2225f9ad9db9617b392ddf653f764b1`\n\n## Koensayr build\n\n- Version: `2.4.0`\n- Git revision: `16f65333696597b084d34931d4c94f7c5352e9e5` (includes `com.innioasis.y1` APK patches under `src/patches/`)\n\n## Build output\n\n- Patched `rom.zip` SHA256: `a791e3de39a27978f15142be02d051fbac57c3e6a8d79088a73db0dbdb39f1b5` (see `build-manifest.json` on this release)\n- Upstream `rom.zip` was re-hashed at build time; output must differ (CI enforces this).\n\n## Patches (`--all`)\n\n- Music-player UX (Artist\u2192Album navigation)\n- Bluetooth pairing (`audio.conf` / `auto_pairing.conf` / `blacklist.conf` / `build.prop`)\n- System config (ADB debugging, bloatware removal)\n- Root (`/system/xbin/su`, mode 06755)\n- AVRCP 1.3 metadata + control + Y1Bridge\n\nDiagnostic scripts (`tools/dual-capture.sh`, gdb attach, `btlog-dump`) are **not** included in the ROM \u2014 see the repo [Diagnostics](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto#diagnostics).\n\n## After flash\n\nIf AVRCP / MultiDex classes fail to load after upgrading from a prior koensayr build:\n\n```bash\nadb shell rm -rf /data/data/com.innioasis.y1/code_cache/secondary-dexes/\n```\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"3d57adebd2837e16ce6846c8f9db675af22024e6511f10205d63552d666da248\",\"size\":447511496,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"7e9b40f11d9e30957dcbacb22a466b48a7313a82fc984361241d855d1057bcd1\",\"size\":332604466,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"485903ed3bed77a718c745ceb436ea57dfd644b4c1aac1c0a200eceb5350b6af\",\"size\":569073375,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"da7a25b25597139254c482e12ac23347ed60490d5e07c7edff205d66e4af3475\",\"size\":393980137,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"60cbd2a344041672ecbe5ff91aa7d36b30f0f62cf4b2519027e97915664137e1\",\"size\":331018749,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"cd2827629c19d795c62c8a6ea20e8f2ca3783157a34f80269a270c857caf58f8\",\"size\":368824999,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-22T22:02:10Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1536},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1538},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"aaf5f3db2e59bb03ea3b9538729c6ade4a5d7ac14b1f9ce717b049d5edcd0f21\",\"original_asset_sizes\":{\"build-manifest.json\":538,\"rom.zip\":328930606},\"original_assets\":[\"build-manifest.json\",\"rom.zip\"],\"platforms\":{\"linux\":\"dc9890e08600c2dcb080efadb96fc66f3e162708c51b7661946a0a1181baff40\",\"linux-arm64\":\"72e3af5c3d33d0717de0dafadd38f0015ca18a9bfc19315936639cb1ecb25627\",\"linux-legacy\":\"b1f4e245a00ab42f4886e0120bc5fcf16980173d8c3fc9ce17563d1ee8f73964\",\"macos\":\"3141d7851b19c79c82182281d24cd0ab08e087ad1e94db87f4fd1b5ba59a6b6f\",\"windows\":\"1c3c3cf5331df0cbeab57bfdbc92f12a10e7c710e27d7fccb1f5298c79ff4efe\",\"windows-legacy\":\"3611da98897a20678d3cd384aa2bddbc48559bf963606bea4d52d93025d0210b\"},\"skipped\":[],\"source_fingerprint\":\"7e6340f3e87523b20c12f7100b3c4194ea4a818e7d15d33bc412b4289b3b75af\",\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"build-manifest.json\":16,\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\":2,\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\":2,\"rom-linux.zip\":3,\"rom-macos.zip\":4,\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\":1,\"rom-windows.zip\":8,\"rom.zip\":10},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-22T22:02:10Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"dri